# Optional email delivery for the contact and product-interest forms.
# Leave these empty in local development and in preview. The forms still
# validate and accept input. They are not forwarded until all three values
# are set. Never commit real values.
#
# 1. Create an API key in a Resend account (https://resend.com).
# 2. Verify the domain you will send from.
# 3. Set CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL to a sender on that domain, for example
#    Northern Studio <notifications@your-verified-domain>
# 4. Set CONTACT_TO_EMAIL to the inbox that should receive enquiries.
# 5. Redeploy, or restart `next dev`. No other service is required.

RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=
